//│ ╙──      	           ^
//│ ╔══[COMPILATION ERROR] Cannot use a value of type 'Int32' at an unrelated type 'Int'
//│ ║  l.+5: 	N2().g(n32)
//│ ╙──      	       ^^^
//│ ╔══[COMPILATION ERROR] Overriding method `g` declares parameter 1 as `(ref null i31)`, but the method it overrides declares `i32`
//│ ║  l.+4: 	  override fun g(m: Int): Int32 = n32
//│ ╙──      	           ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^


